  {
   "id": 529186,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "At what percentile is the University of Missouri (Columbia campus), whose average SAT score is 1244?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>You want the percentile rank of 1244.</p>\n<p>Open a copy of the file in Google Sheets. You cannot edit the original file.</p>\n<p>Look for the AvgSAT tab.</p>\n<p>Look for the Average SAT Score column.</p>\n<p>In a blank cell, enter the function: =PERCENTRANK(</p>\n<p>Click on the letter at the top of the Average SAT Score column.</p>\n<p>Then enter a comma, 1244, and close the parentheses: ,1244)</p>\n<p>The complete function probably looks like this: =PERCENTRANK(C:C,1244).</p>\n<p>You see the decimal value 0.827.</p>\n<p>Convert this to a percentage to say that this is the 82.7<sup>th</sup> percentile.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "82.7th"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
